      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW LOVISA (7) has a strong overall record having eight wins and 12 places from 30 starts but was out of the money last time when sixth (34.82) over 595m at Sandown. Form at the trip sound including five wins. Drawn out but with clear running expected to go close. PAW NIMBUS (1) quickly away to win over the 500m at Bendigo two runs back then prominent throughout when finishing second at Sandown last start. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Leading player again. PAW HARKONNEN (8) had a tough draw to overcome and was game in defeat when only a neck from City Limit in second (27.51) at this track. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Overdue and is among the main hopes. CHILL OUT PLATE (3) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a 1.5 lengths third (24.00) in a Special conditions H at Bendigo.",
